+## [v11.4.0](https://github.com/laravel/laravel/compare/v11.3.3...v11.4.0) - 2024-12-02
+
+* [11.x] Narrow down array types to lists by [@DvDty](https://github.com/DvDty) in https://github.com/laravel/laravel/pull/6497
